<title>SWITZERLAND: Clariant H1 net profit rises 14 pct.</title>
<headline>Clariant H1 net profit rises 14 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MUTTENZ, Switzerland</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30:</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net profit	     64		  vs 56</p>
<p>  in percent of sales, pct  5.6		 vs 4.9</p>
<p> Cash flow			123		 vs 113</p>
<p>  in percent of sales	 10.8		vs 9.9</p>
<p> Sales			    1,139	     vs 1,137</p>
<p> Operating profit	     111		 vs 114</p>
<p>  in percent of sales	 9.8		 vs 10.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the Swiss chemicals group is Clariant International AG.</p>
</text>
